cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-loader-mt101 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-loader-mt101: SWIFT MT101 to ISO 20022 pain.001 records"
abstract: >-
  A companion library to pain001 that parses legacy SWIFT MT101 Request
  for Transfer messages into the flat records pain001 validates and turns
  into ISO 20022 pain.001 XML, one record per transaction.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.74"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
